    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14578" root="ربق" body-key="r">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارتبق</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a kid) <i>had his head put into the</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِبْقَة</span>. (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارتبق فِى حِبَالَتِى</span> <i>He</i> (a
gazelle, S, K) <i>became caught in my snare.</i> (Lh,
JK, S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارتبقتُ فِى حِبَالَتِهِ</span> (tropical:)  <i>I became
caught in</i> [<i>the snare of</i>] <i>his deceit.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4- 
And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارتبق فِى الأَمْرِ</span> (assumed tropical:)  <i>He fell into the thing,</i> or
<i>affair.</i> (Msb, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِرْتَبَقْتُهُ لِنَفْسِى</span> <i>I tied, bound,</i>
or <i>made fast, him,</i> or <i>it, for myself.</i> (TA.)

